cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "bhoonidhi-stac: ISRO Bhoonidhi scene metadata as a STAC catalogue"
abstract: >-
  bhoonidhi-stac turns scene metadata from ISRO's Bhoonidhi archive into
  SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog (STAC) collections and items, with each
  collection's licence and credit, and splits portal searches so none loses
  scenes to the portal's result limit. It builds the public catalogue at
  https://bhoonidhi-stac.ecotrakr.in, which holds metadata only.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aditya
    family-names: Sharma
    alias: geovicco-dev
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-6154-086X"
repository-code: "https://github.com/geovicco-dev/bhoonidhi-stac"
url: "https://bhoonidhi-stac.ecotrakr.in"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - STAC
  - pgSTAC
  - remote sensing
  - earth observation
  - satellite imagery
  - ISRO
  - Bhoonidhi
  - NRSC
version: 0.1.0
